# covers: 8 Collection sorting
# covers: 8 Collection searching
# covers: 8 Collection copying
# covers: 4 Nested loops
# covers: 22 Deeply nested control flow
# covers: 6 Recursion with mutable state
# kind: positive
# expect: run
# exit: 0
# stdout: 1
# stdout: 3
# stdout: 5
# stdout: 7
# stdout: 9
# stdout: 3

sorting is module
sorting purpose "Sort a list in place with a bubble sort, then search it"
sorting path sorting
sorting imports standard.console
sorting imports standard.math
sorting imports standard.compare
sorting imports standard.list
sorting exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter scope none

showInt is operation
showInt purpose "Print one whole number on its own line"
showInt invariant none
showInt typeParam none
showInt input value Int64 value
showInt output none
showInt outputOwner none
showInt raises none
showInt effect write console.stdout
showInt uses stdoutWriter
showInt memory heap false
showInt async false
showInt maxRecursion none
showInt label begin loopKind none
showInt label begin within none
showInt label done loopKind none
showInt label done within none
showInt at begin do writeValue
showInt at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showInt at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showInt
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue arg value Int64 value copy
writeValue out none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError

Numbers is instance
Numbers purpose "A growable list of whole numbers"
Numbers instantiates list.List Int64

sortInPlace is operation
sortInPlace purpose "Sort a list of five numbers in ascending order with a bubble sort"
sortInPlace invariant none
sortInPlace typeParam none
sortInPlace input numbers Numbers borrowedMutable
sortInPlace output none
sortInPlace outputOwner none
sortInPlace raises list.IndexOutOfRange
sortInPlace effect none
sortInPlace uses none
sortInPlace memory heap false
sortInPlace async false
sortInPlace maxRecursion none
sortInPlace label begin loopKind none
sortInPlace label begin within none
sortInPlace label passes loopKind counted
sortInPlace label passes within none
sortInPlace label passes maxIterations 5
sortInPlace label passes counter pass
sortInPlace label startPass loopKind none
sortInPlace label startPass within passes
sortInPlace label compareStep loopKind counted
sortInPlace label compareStep within passes
sortInPlace label compareStep maxIterations 4
sortInPlace label compareStep counter position
sortInPlace label readPair loopKind none
sortInPlace label readPair within compareStep
sortInPlace label readRightStep loopKind none
sortInPlace label readRightStep within compareStep
sortInPlace label decide loopKind none
sortInPlace label decide within compareStep
sortInPlace label swap loopKind none
sortInPlace label swap within compareStep
sortInPlace label writeRightStep loopKind none
sortInPlace label writeRightStep within compareStep
sortInPlace label advance loopKind none
sortInPlace label advance within compareStep
sortInPlace label nextPass loopKind none
sortInPlace label nextPass within passes
sortInPlace label sorted loopKind none
sortInPlace label sorted within none
sortInPlace label brokenLeft loopKind none
sortInPlace label brokenLeft within none
sortInPlace label brokenRight loopKind none
sortInPlace label brokenRight within none
sortInPlace label brokenWriteLeft loopKind none
sortInPlace label brokenWriteLeft within none
sortInPlace label brokenWriteRight loopKind none
sortInPlace label brokenWriteRight within none
sortInPlace let first immutable Int64 0
sortInPlace let one immutable Int64 1
sortInPlace let passCount immutable Int64 5
sortInPlace let lastPair immutable Int64 4
sortInPlace let pass mutable Int64 0
sortInPlace let position mutable Int64 0
sortInPlace at begin goto passes
sortInPlace at passes do passesDone
sortInPlace at passes branch if allPasses goto sorted else goto startPass
sortInPlace at startPass set position first
sortInPlace at startPass goto compareStep
sortInPlace at compareStep do pairsDone
sortInPlace at compareStep branch if allPairs goto nextPass else goto readPair
sortInPlace at readPair do nextPosition
sortInPlace at readPair do readLeft
sortInPlace at readPair branch ifError readLeft goto brokenLeft else goto readRightStep
sortInPlace at readRightStep do readRight
sortInPlace at readRightStep branch ifError readRight goto brokenRight else goto decide
sortInPlace at decide do outOfOrder
sortInPlace at decide branch if needsSwap goto swap else goto advance
sortInPlace at swap do writeLeft
sortInPlace at swap branch ifError writeLeft goto brokenWriteLeft else goto writeRightStep
sortInPlace at writeRightStep do writeRight
sortInPlace at writeRightStep branch ifError writeRight goto brokenWriteRight else goto advance
sortInPlace at advance set position following
sortInPlace at advance goto compareStep
sortInPlace at nextPass do countPass
sortInPlace at nextPass set pass nextPassValue
sortInPlace at nextPass goto passes
sortInPlace at sorted return ok none
sortInPlace at brokenLeft return error leftError
sortInPlace at brokenRight return error rightError
sortInPlace at brokenWriteLeft return error writeLeftError
sortInPlace at brokenWriteRight return error writeRightError

passesDone is call
passesDone in sortInPlace
passesDone invokes compare.greaterOrEqualInt64
passesDone arg left Int64 pass copy
passesDone arg right Int64 passCount copy
passesDone out allPasses Bool
passesDone ownedBy none
passesDone cleanedBy none
passesDone borrows none
passesDone catch none

pairsDone is call
pairsDone in sortInPlace
pairsDone invokes compare.greaterOrEqualInt64
pairsDone arg left Int64 position copy
pairsDone arg right Int64 lastPair copy
pairsDone out allPairs Bool
pairsDone ownedBy none
pairsDone cleanedBy none
pairsDone borrows none
pairsDone catch none

nextPosition is call
nextPosition in sortInPlace
nextPosition invokes math.addInt64
nextPosition arg left Int64 position copy
nextPosition arg right Int64 one copy
nextPosition out following Int64
nextPosition ownedBy none
nextPosition cleanedBy none
nextPosition borrows none
nextPosition catch none

readLeft is call
readLeft in sortInPlace
readLeft invokes Numbers.get
readLeft arg list Numbers numbers lend
readLeft arg index Int64 position copy
readLeft out leftValue Int64
readLeft ownedBy none
readLeft cleanedBy none
readLeft borrows none
readLeft catch leftError list.IndexOutOfRange

readRight is call
readRight in sortInPlace
readRight invokes Numbers.get
readRight arg list Numbers numbers lend
readRight arg index Int64 following copy
readRight out rightValue Int64
readRight ownedBy none
readRight cleanedBy none
readRight borrows none
readRight catch rightError list.IndexOutOfRange

outOfOrder is call
outOfOrder in sortInPlace
outOfOrder invokes compare.greaterThanInt64
outOfOrder arg left Int64 leftValue copy
outOfOrder arg right Int64 rightValue copy
outOfOrder out needsSwap Bool
outOfOrder ownedBy none
outOfOrder cleanedBy none
outOfOrder borrows none
outOfOrder catch none

writeLeft is call
writeLeft in sortInPlace
writeLeft invokes Numbers.set
writeLeft arg list Numbers numbers lendMutable
writeLeft arg index Int64 position copy
writeLeft arg item Int64 rightValue copy
writeLeft out none
writeLeft ownedBy none
writeLeft cleanedBy none
writeLeft borrows none
writeLeft catch writeLeftError list.IndexOutOfRange

writeRight is call
writeRight in sortInPlace
writeRight invokes Numbers.set
writeRight arg list Numbers numbers lendMutable
writeRight arg index Int64 following copy
writeRight arg item Int64 leftValue copy
writeRight out none
writeRight ownedBy none
writeRight cleanedBy none
writeRight borrows none
writeRight catch writeRightError list.IndexOutOfRange

countPass is call
countPass in sortInPlace
countPass invokes math.addInt64
countPass arg left Int64 pass copy
countPass arg right Int64 one copy
countPass out nextPassValue Int64
countPass ownedBy none
countPass cleanedBy none
countPass borrows none
countPass catch none

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParam none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwner none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap true
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label printAll loopKind forEach
main label printAll within none
main label printAll maxIterations 5
main label printAll over numbers
main label printItem loopKind none
main label printItem within printAll
main label searchSeven loopKind none
main label searchSeven within none
main label search loopKind counted
main label search within none
main label search maxIterations 5
main label search counter probeIndex
main label probe loopKind none
main label probe within search
main label checkProbe loopKind none
main label checkProbe within search
main label nextProbe loopKind none
main label nextProbe within search
main label found loopKind none
main label found within none
main label notThere loopKind none
main label notThere within none
main label broken loopKind none
main label broken within none
main let five immutable Int64 5
main let three immutable Int64 3
main let nine immutable Int64 9
main let one immutable Int64 1
main let seven immutable Int64 7
main let zero immutable Int64 0
main let probeIndex mutable Int64 0
main let probeLimit immutable Int64 5
main let failCode immutable ExitCode 1
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main at begin do makeNumbers
main at begin do appendFive
main at begin do appendThree
main at begin do appendNine
main at begin do appendOne
main at begin do appendSeven
main at begin do sortThem
main at begin branch ifError sortThem goto broken else goto printAll
main at printAll branch ifNext numbers bind item Int64 goto printItem else goto searchSeven
main at printItem do showItem
main at printItem goto printAll
main at searchSeven goto search
main at search do searchDone
main at search branch if searchFinished goto notThere else goto probe
main at probe do readProbe
main at probe branch ifError readProbe goto broken else goto checkProbe
main at checkProbe do isSeven
main at checkProbe branch if foundSeven goto found else goto nextProbe
main at nextProbe do advanceProbe
main at nextProbe set probeIndex advancedProbe
main at nextProbe goto search
main at found do showProbe
main at found return ok okCode
main at notThere return ok failCode
main at broken return ok failCode

scratch is region
scratch in main
scratch strategy arena
scratch capacity 4096
scratch released atReturn

makeNumbers is call
makeNumbers in main
makeNumbers invokes Numbers.new
makeNumbers arg region Region scratch lend
makeNumbers out numbers Numbers
makeNumbers ownedBy scratch
makeNumbers cleanedBy none
makeNumbers borrows none
makeNumbers catch none

